  <owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="https://sdhss.org/ontology/shortcuts/P10">
    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E62" />
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">This property associates any instance of crm:E1 CRM Entity with one
      or more literal strings representing additional human-readable labels beyond the primary label
      documented using sdh-short:P9 has standard label.
      Alternative labels may include, but are not limited to:

      Labels in other languages
      Historical or variant spellings
      Abbreviations, aliases, or commonly used alternative names

      This property is conceptually equivalent to skos:altLabel and is likewise defined as a
      shortcut property to facilitate easy access to non-preferred appellations.
      Semantically, this property is a shortcut for the following path: crm:E1 CRM Entity → sdh:P11i
      has appellation for language → sdh:C11 Appellation in a Language → sdh:P13 refers to name →
      crm:E41 Appellation → crm:P190 has symbolic content → crm:E62 String
      This property MAY be repeated multiple times for a single instance. No ordering or preference
      is implied among alternative labels.
      This property does not replace the explicit modelling of appellations using sdh:C11
      Appellation in a Language and crm:E41 Appellation, but provides a simplified access point for
      applications.
      The property is intended purely for presentation and identification, not for analytical or
      classificatory reasoning. Full appellation modelling should be preserved when detailed
      linguistic, historical, or contextual analysis is required.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">has alternative label</rdfs:label>
    <skos:notation rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">sdh-short:P10</skos:notation>
    <owl:sameAs rdf:resource="https://ontome.net/ontology/p3202" />
    <rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E21_Person" />
